# Python virtualenv for Presidio backend — the server script itself is
# tracked, but the 1 GB+ venv (spaCy models, scipy, etc) is platform-
# specific and recreated via:
#   python -m venv presidio-backend
#   presidio-backend/Scripts/pip install presidio-analyzer presidio-anonymizer spacy
#   presidio-backend/Scripts/python -m spacy download en_core_web_lg
presidio-backend/Include/
presidio-backend/Lib/
presidio-backend/Scripts/
presidio-backend/pyvenv.cfg
presidio-backend/__pycache__/
presidio-backend/*.pyc
